## 4. Adaptable Youth Curriculum Modules
Programs can be seamlessly integrated into Physical Education classes, advisory periods, or after-school athletics:

1. **Focus & Calm Classroom Reset (20–30 mins):** Gentle desk-side or gym floor breathwork and physical alignment to improve focus before testing or advisory periods.
2. **Student-Athlete Mobility & Mental Conditioning (45–60 mins):** Joint stabilization, functional flexibility, and breathing techniques to enhance athletic recovery and prevent sports injury.
3. **Faculty & Staff De-Stress Sessions (45 mins):** Specialized teacher-wellness sessions scheduled during professional development or after dismissal to reduce educator burnout.

